docs {
  # List ActiveGates with update jobs

  The response includes ActiveGates that have both completed (successful and failed) jobs and jobs in progress.

  **Auth:** OAuth (inherited from collection)

  **Required OAuth scopes:** `environment-api:activegates:read`, `fleet-management:activegates:read`

  **API token scopes:** activeGates.read
}
